{"title":"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One week, Ana recorded the time she spent playing soccer on the bar graph shown. How many hours, in total, did she spend playing soccer that week?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(bar graph: Sunday -&gt; 2 hrs, Monday -&gt; 1 hour, Tuesday -&gt; 0.5 hours, Wednesday -&gt; 1 hour, Thursday -&gt; 0 hours, Friday -&gt; 0.5 hours, Saturday -&gt; 2.5 hours)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the bar graph, we see that she played soccer for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours on Sunday, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour on Monday, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192b4a258ee998961a99523fd0f0a029f9ea194a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> hours on Tuesday, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on Wednesday, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on Thursday, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192b4a258ee998961a99523fd0f0a029f9ea194a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> hours on Friday, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40cba44ffc429fc98e11a1605ced22243b655f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> hours on Saturday.\n</p><p>Thus, in total, she played for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd670090f8b700a73ab047360d953cc2d6ba0b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 1 + 0.5 + 1 + 0 + 0.5 + 2.5 = 3 + 1.5 + 0.5 + 2.5 = 4.5 + 3 = \\boxed{7.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"548\" height=\"25\" /> hours.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC\">2021 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></